  "_note_transfer_update": "2026-07-08 transfer-mode update: every face pair is now loc_space=head_local (measured end-to-end on the reference character: smile error 1.75mm RMS/15.8mm max -> 0.34mm/2.3mm). Rigify mouth masters/corners carry LOC_ROT again - the engine now allows rotation alongside head-local LOC, restoring the authored funnel/roll (up to ~29 deg) and corner-tilt (~10 deg) rotations that were previously discarded. Face motion is auto-normalized to the target's face size at bake (eye-distance ratio).",
  "_note_lips_reverted": "2026-07-09: all lip/mouth pairs reverted to channels=LOC (location only). The LOC_ROT lip rotation required an engine gate-lift that broke CloudRig's face, so the rotation work was pulled. loc_space (head_local) is unchanged."
}
